/selectionvisualizer - basic command
/svis - basic command
/svis beacon - Shows beacon active range
/svis biome (fixy) - Shows biome edges
/svis cb - Shows command block target area
/svis chunk - Shows current chunk
/svis cmi - Shows CMI selection
/svis fc (fixy) - Shows Factions claims
/svis gd (fixy) - Shows GriefDefender claims
/svis gp (fixy) - Shows GriefPrevention claims
/svis grid (fixy) - Shows chunk grid
/svis gui [type] - Opens GUI to edit personal settings
/svis jobs - Shows jobs restricted areas
/svis k (fixy) - Shows Kingdoms claims
/svis lands (-s) (-a) - Shows Lands regions
/svis plot (fixy) - Shows PlotSquared plots
/svis point (fixy) - Point to a target
/svis reload - Reloads configuration file
/svis res (residenceName) (-s) (-a) - Shows Residence regions
/svis spawner - Shows spawner active and spawn range
/svis stop - Stops currently showing particles
/svis toggle - Toggles visualizer
/svis towny (fixy) - Shows Towny claims
/svis watch [stop/info/playername] - See other player selections
/svis we (paste) (lock/tp) - Shows WorldEdit selection or copied area
/svis wg (regionName) - Shows WorldGuard regions
